sequenceDiagram
    participant P0 as Student / UI
    participant P1 as Supabase Auth
    participant P2 as FastAPI
    participant P3 as PostgreSQL
    participant P4 as OpenRouter
    P0->>P1: Login: email/password or OAuth
    P1->>P0: Session / access token
    P0->>P2: GET /cases: bearer token
    P2->>P3: Read published public metadata
    P2->>P0: Safe case list
    P0->>P2: POST /simulation/sessions/from-case: code, mode
    P2->>P3: Store owned session + case version
    P2->>P0: Session ID / safe state
    P0->>P2: POST /sessions/{id}/messages: message
    P2->>P4: Case-grounded model request
    P4->>P2: Model response
    P2->>P0: PatientReply
    P0->>P2: POST examinations / investigations: item name
    P2->>P3: Apply action; persist state
    P2->>P0: Clinical result / state
    P0->>P2: POST diagnosis: diagnosis, treatment plan; POST complete
    P2->>P3: Persist completion
    P0->>P2: GET clinical-review
    P2->>P0: Review; scoring details unverified
